			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Hallo most of ye dunno know me. I am Pramethius Of Ordaen De Brell. I wanted to stop in to say hallo and to let you know the current status of ODB. We currently are working hard to rebuild it. Although Our efforts seem to be vein. There seems to be at best count bout 15 members left  standing strong trying to rebuild our once great guild. I also would like to ask if the allince between Ordaen De Brell And Your beloved Guild Will Still Stand Untell or if We fall (Ordaen De Brell that is)? Most all of our standing members range into there 45th season and above. Things be comin bout Hard for us and some of us not even know why things happened. Neo knows but he says its a long story and I am not sure I wanna know. Is there a place a fello can get a Ale round here and rest his tired bones for a bit? Maybe swap a story sometime.
