				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=13215&amp;sid=da689d9e786de5221f3f25c0e5a009e0#13215"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Tue Aug 20, 2002 9:44 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=13215&amp;sid=da689d9e786de5221f3f25c0e5a009e0"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">You bet the alliance is still there. We are pretty much the same Concordat Angelis that has been.  A few faces have changed but the drive and spirit is the same.  Most of our members range around 20-40 with a few above and a few below.  We regurlarly strike fear into the evil minds and hearts in places that suit this level of experience.  As always, Ordaen de Brell are welcome to come along.  Well, unless you've all of a sudden started taking up with the likes of necromancers and shadowknights or started encouraging folks to leave their wits at home when they strike out on an adventure and I don't think there's anything to worry about there.  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Swing by the Kindred Spirits sometime and enjoy some of the finest ales in all of Norrath.  Be warned though, there is an Iksar that lurks about there claiming to be of the purest mind.  So far he hasn't bitten anyone or taken off any children... that we know of.  Look forward to seeing you soon! 
<br />
Marcelas Hiddenstrike
<br />

<br />
Scout of the Concordat
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
<i></i><br />_________________<br />The good thing about repeating your mistakes is that you know when to duck.</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
