			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">He best not ever be tryin ta still any children cause he have me and many friends to be dealin with. 
<br />

<br />
I have nay yet been able to get the chance to rip an iskar's tail of n choke em with it
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
OOC The talk about letting evil class and race's is going on as we speak I personaly do not want this and the out come will bring on my decision to stay or go
<br />

<br />
If things stay the way they should and evil is not alowed in ODB then the recrutment stage will begin and we will target younger folk so that we can rebuild our numbers. and regain our stand against evil on norrath and the near by moon.  
